    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/trifolius-presbyter/pl63_3_tri#PL63.TRI.3.s5",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/trifolius-presbyter/pl63_3_tri",
    "canonical_ref": "PL63.TRI.3.s5",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": ", stantinopolitana, Ephesina prima, et Chalcedonensis et quod in epistolis sanctorum Patrum, quas quatuor sanctæ synodi in auctoritate fidei esse voluerunt,",
    "chunk_index": 10,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 519,
    "date_range": [
      519,
      520
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/trifolius-presbyter/pl63_3_tri#PL63.TRI.3.s6",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/trifolius-presbyter/pl63_3_tri",
    "canonical_ref": "PL63.TRI.3.s6",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "id est Athanasii episcopi Alexandrini ad Epictetum epi­ scopum, Cyrilli ad Nestorium una, et ad Joannem Antiochenum altera, et epistolis papæ Leonis.",
    "chunk_index": 11,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 519,
    "date_range": [
      519,
      520
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/trifolius-presbyter/pl63_3_tri#PL63.TRI.3.s7",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/trifolius-presbyter/pl63_3_tri",
    "canonical_ref": "PL63.TRI.3.s7",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Si quis addere, aut minuere, aut aliter interpretari vo­ luerit, quam Patres in supra scriptis, autin deiinitione sua non posuerunt synodi, quivis ille sit qui super- ponit, hsereticus est.",
    "chunk_index": 12,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 519,
    "date_range": [
      519,
      520
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/trifolius-presbyter/pl63_3_tri#PL63.TRI.3.s8",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/trifolius-presbyter/pl63_3_tri",
    "canonical_ref": "PL63.TRI.3.s8",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Nam Pater et Filius et Spiritus sanctus tres personæ, unus Deus, vox et verbum et fla­ tus. Vox Pater est, verbum Filius, flatus est Spiritus sanctus.",
    "chunk_index": 13,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 519,
    "date_range": [
      519,
      520
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/trifolius-presbyter/pl63_3_tri#PL63.TRI.3.s9",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/trifolius-presbyter/pl63_3_tri",
    "canonical_ref": "PL63.TRI.3.s9",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Persona Patris et persona sancti Spiritus sine carne : persona vero Filii, quae semper cum Patre et Spi­ ritusancto fuit, in Trinitateest, idest Verbum Dei.",
    "chunk_index": 14,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 519,
    "date_range": [
      519,
      520
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/trifolius-presbyter/pl63_3_tri#PL63.TRI.3.s10",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/trifolius-presbyter/pl63_3_tri",
    "canonical_ref": "PL63.TRI.3.s10",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Deus ingressus in utero Virginis Marise assumpsit de ea na­ turam'carnis, non personam.",
    "chunk_index": 15,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 519,
    "date_range": [
      519,
      520
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/trifolius-presbyter/pl63_3_tri#PL63.TRI.3.s11",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/trifolius-presbyter/pl63_3_tri",
    "canonical_ref": "PL63.TRI.3.s11",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Ideo quod Dominus noster Jesus Christus duæ naturæ, una persona Verbum, id est Filius Dei Deus immortalis, invisibilis, impassibilis. Caro istius verbi mortalis, visibilis, passibilis.",
    "chunk_index": 16,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 519,
    "date_range": [
      519,
      520
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/trifolius-presbyter/pl63_3_tri#PL63.TRI.3.s12",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/trifolius-presbyter/pl63_3_tri",
    "canonical_ref": "PL63.TRI.3.s12",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Pater non est Pater Trinitatis, sed Filii, et Filius non est Trinitatis, sed Patris, et Spiritus sanctus non proce­ dit de Trinitate, sed de Patre et Filio.",
    "chunk_index": 17,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 519,
    "date_range": [
      519,
      520
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/trifolius-presbyter/pl63_3_tri#PL63.TRI.3.s13",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/trifolius-presbyter/pl63_3_tri",
    "canonical_ref": "PL63.TRI.3.s13",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Non sunt tres Dii, neque tres Patres, neque tres Filii, neque tres Spiritus sancti.",
    "chunk_index": 18,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 519,
    "date_range": [
      519,
      520
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/trifolius-presbyter/pl63_3_tri#PL63.TRI.3.s14",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/trifolius-presbyter/pl63_3_tri",
    "canonical_ref": "PL63.TRI.3.s14",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Qui unum de Trinitate dicunt pas­ sum, si Ariani non sunt, dicant de quibus tribus unus passus est.",
    "chunk_index": 19,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 519,
    "date_range": [
      519,
      520
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/trifolius-presbyter/pl63_3_tri#PL63.TRI.3.s15",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/trifolius-presbyter/pl63_3_tri",
    "canonical_ref": "PL63.TRI.3.s15",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "De tribus Patribus, aut de tribus Filiis, aut de tribus Spiritibus sanctis, aut certe de tribus Diis, sicut dicit Arius. Unus Deus creator, impassi­ bilis, immortalis.",
    "chunk_index": 20,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 519,
    "date_range": [
      519,
      520
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/trifolius-presbyter/pl63_3_tri#PL63.TRI.3.s16",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/trifolius-presbyter/pl63_3_tri",
    "canonical_ref": "PL63.TRI.3.s16",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Alter vero Deus creatus, passibilis, et mortalis, aut sicut Sabellius dicit, quia tres per­ sonas esse negat, sed tantum dici putat.",
    "chunk_index": 21,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 519,
    "date_range": [
      519,
      520
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/trifolius-presbyter/pl63_3_tri#PL63.TRI.3.s17",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/trifolius-presbyter/pl63_3_tri",
    "canonical_ref": "PL63.TRI.3.s17",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "ideo unum de Trinitate Patrem dixit incarnatum et passum. Apollinaris vero negat Christum animam et intel­ lectum habuisse et pro anima et intellectu, inquit, Deus ei fuit.",
    "chunk_index": 22,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 519,
    "date_range": [
      519,
      520
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/trifolius-presbyter/pl63_3_tri#PL63.TRI.3.s18",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/trifolius-presbyter/pl63_3_tri",
    "canonical_ref": "PL63.TRI.3.s18",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Ideo dicit unum de Trinitate passum in carne, Si unus de Trinitate passus est in carne, caro mansit impassibilis :",
    "chunk_index": 23,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 519,
    "date_range": [
      519,
      520
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/trifolius-presbyter/pl63_3_tri#PL63.TRI.3.s19",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/trifolius-presbyter/pl63_3_tri",
    "canonical_ref": "PL63.TRI.3.s19",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "qui Ullum de Trinitate Fi­ lium dicunt passum, duos aut tres Filios colunt, ex quibus unus passus est, duo manent impassibiles.",
    "chunk_index": 24,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 519,
    "date_range": [
      519,
      520
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/trifolius-presbyter/pl63_3_tri#PL63.TRI.3.s20",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/trifolius-presbyter/pl63_3_tri",
    "canonical_ref": "PL63.TRI.3.s20",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Si vero de Trinitate est Filius, non est de Patre secun­ dum deitatem, neque de matre secundum carnem, sed de Trinitate Trinitas, et unus de Trinitate qua­ tuor fiunt,",
    "chunk_index": 25,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 519,
    "date_range": [
      519,
      520
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/trifolius-presbyter/pl63_3_tri#PL63.TRI.3.s21",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/trifolius-presbyter/pl63_3_tri",
    "canonical_ref": "PL63.TRI.3.s21",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "sicut dicit Nestorius, Filius Mariae asso- ciatus est Filio Dei, et factus est communis Triuitati, et passus est unus de Trinitate.",
    "chunk_index": 26,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 519,
    "date_range": [
      519,
      520
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/trifolius-presbyter/pl63_3_tri#PL63.TRI.3.s22",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/trifolius-presbyter/pl63_3_tri",
    "canonical_ref": "PL63.TRI.3.s22",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Arius unum Deum dividit in duos Deos. Nestorius addendo alterum Fi­ lium secundum carnem Trinitati, facit quatuor per­ sonas.",
    "chunk_index": 27,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 519,
    "date_range": [
      519,
      520
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/trifolius-presbyter/pl63_3_tri#PL63.TRI.3.s23",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/trifolius-presbyter/pl63_3_tri",
    "canonical_ref": "PL63.TRI.3.s23",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Eutyches duas naturas unici Filii Dei commi­ scet, sicut pistor farinam et aquam; jam nec farinam nec aquam, sed tertium id est panem.",
    "chunk_index": 28,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 519,
    "date_range": [
      519,
      520
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/trifolius-presbyter/pl63_3_tri#PL63.TRI.3.s24",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/trifolius-presbyter/pl63_3_tri",
    "canonical_ref": "PL63.TRI.3.s24",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Sicut et Eu­ tyches commiscet naturas Dei et hominis, et jam nec Deus, nec homo, nec Pater, nec Filius, nec Spiritus sanctus est., sed est ille unus de Trini­ tate.",
    "chunk_index": 29,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 519,
    "date_range": [
      519,
